<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71843" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξῦσ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ulceration, erosion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἐντέρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					60
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>excoriation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>scraping, filing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.781
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in Int.</u>
				23.21
			</span></i>, <u>PMed.</u>in<i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				4.270
			</span></i> ; <i>polishing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				611.20
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύσις</span> is f.l.
			in codd.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
